id: terrifying-technique
name: Terrifying Technique
talentCategory: technique
prerequisites: Terrifying Presence, Favored Technique
description: >
  Your terrifying demeanor is displayed even in your attacks, shaking others to their core when you use your Favored Technique.
text: >
  Terrifying Technique: Your terrifying demeanor is displayed even in your attacks, shaking others to their core when you use your Favored Technique.
  –Prerequisites: Terrifying Presence, Favored Technique
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Signature Techniques against Characters with the Shaken Combat Condition by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Energy Charge Maneuver and select your Favored Technique as its declared Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Terrify Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) A Signature Technique's Wound against each one Shaken, as the Damage is worked out per target (chat.mjs
# shakenTechniqueParts).
wound.signatureVsShaken += 1(T);
# (2) The Energy Charge with the Favored Technique declared: the Terrify out of sequence, offered on its card - once a Round,
# counted when taken (chat.mjs terrifyingTechniqueOffer).
allow terrifyingTechnique.terrify;
